    fix: retry an environment or skybox URL after a failed load (#5197)
    
    TextureUtils cached the load promise per URL and kept it when the load
    rejected, so a skybox-image or environment-image URL that failed once
    (network error, temporary 404) failed again on every later request until
    the page was reloaded. Drop the cache entry when the load fails.
